<DataEntry>[0]</DataEntry>
<Description>it&apos;s used when generating PUSCH DMRS sequence when Transform Precoding is enabled. 1 denotes group hopping is enabled for the UE. 0, otherwise.</Description>
<HideCondition>0==TransformPrecodingEnabled || PUSCH_Enable==0</HideCondition>
<Show><T>Bool</T><D>0</D></Show>
<Validate><T>Int</T><D>13</D></Validate></Item>
