<Item XName="PUSCH_DMRS_NumPorts" Type="PartParam">
<DataEntry>[1]</DataEntry>
<Description>number of DMRS ports used by each PUSCH. Number of layers is equal to number of DMRS ports.</Description>
<HideCondition>PUSCH_Enable==0</HideCondition>
<Show><T>Bool</T><D>0</D></Show>
<Validate><T>Int</T><D>13</D></Validate></Item>
<Item XName="PUSCH_DMRS_PortList" Type="PartParam">
<DataEntry>[0]</DataEntry>
<Description>the DMRS ports set used by each PUSCH. Ports number for each PUSCH is specified by PUSCH_DMRS_NumPorts.</Description>
<HideCondition>PUSCH_Enable==0</HideCondition>
<Show><T>Bool</T><D>0</D></Show>
<Validate><T>Int</T><D>13</D></Validate></Item>
<Item XName="PUSCH_DMRS_PowerBoosting" Type="PartParam">
<DataEntry>[0]</DataEntry>
<Description>PUSCH DMRS power boosting for each PUSCH in dB.</Description>
<HideCondition>PUSCH_Enable==0</HideCondition>
<Show><T>Bool</T><D>0</D></Show>
<Validate><T>Int</T><D>14</D></Validate></Item>
<Item XName="PUSCH_DMRS_SequenceHoppingEnabled" Type="PartParam">
<DataEntry>[0]</DataEntry>
<Description>it&apos;s used when generating PUSCH DMRS sequence when Transform Precoding is enabled. 1 denotes sequence hopping is enabled for the UE. 0, otherwise.</Description>
<HideCondition>0==TransformPrecodingEnabled || PUSCH_Enable==0</HideCondition>
<Show><T>Bool</T><D>0</D></Show>
<Validate><T>Int</T><D>13</D></Validate></Item>
<Item XName="PUSCH_DMRS_TypeA_Pos" Type="PartParam">
<DataEntry>[2]</DataEntry>
