<DataEntry>[14]</DataEntry>
<Description>number of OFDM symbols for each PDSCH.</Description>
<HideCondition>PUSCH_Enable==0</HideCondition>
<Show><T>Bool</T><D>0</D></Show>
<Validate><T>Int</T><D>13</D></Validate></Item>
<Item XName="PUSCH_NumRBs" Type="PartParam">
<DataEntry>NR_NumRBs</DataEntry>
<Description>number of resource blocks (RBs) for each PDSCH.</Description>
<HideCondition>0==PUSCH_Enable || 0==PUSCH_ResourceAllocationType</HideCondition>
<Show><T>Bool</T><D>0</D></Show>
<Validate><T>Int</T><D>13</D></Validate></Item>
<Item XName="PUSCH_PTRS_DMRS_PortsAssociation" Type="PartParam">
<DataEntry>[0]</DataEntry>
<Description>indicates the association between PTRS ports and DMRS ports when TransformPrecodingEnabled is NO. Range 0~3. Refer to Table 7.3.1.1.2-25/26 in 38.212.</Description>
<Enum />
